OL,3,GNEWSAHospital parking petition 'voices
OL,4,Awill be heard'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe councillor behind a petition to
OL,7,Fcreate multi-storey car parks at a
OL,8,Fcity's hospitals says the signatories'
OL,9,F'voices will be heard'.
OL,11,FOxfordshire county councillor David
OL,12,FHenwood, says the inaction on hospital
OL,13,Fparking is "incredibly frustrating".
OL,15,FAlmost 2,000 people signed the petition
OL,16,Fcalling for an investigation into
OL,17,Fimproving parking and access at the
OL,18,FJohn Radcliffe and Churchill Hospitals.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
