OL,3,GNEWSAHospital parking petition 'voices
OL,4,Awill be heard'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxford University Hospitals Trust
OL,7,Fannounced plans to build five
OL,8,Fmulti-storey car parks at three sites
OL,9,Fin 2017, but now says "creating
OL,10,Fsignificant numbers of additional
OL,11,Fparking spaces is not straightforward
OL,12,Fand, in many cases, <not> a viable
OL,13,Foption".
